    "text": "Let $\\mathrm{r}, \\mathrm{v}, \\mathrm{E}$ be the radius of orbit, speed of electron and total energy of electron respectively in a $\\mathrm{H}$-atom. Which of the following quantities according to Bohr theory, is proportional to the quantum number $\\mathrm{n}$ ?",
